title: Mod Info
subtitle: About the mod and everything around it.

= About

Welcome to the modification, my dear player. Would you like to see Redux but in different style? You are welcome.

This modification's purpose is very general - to be expansion to the base game. 

- @versions: Versions
- @root: Go back.

@versions
go-to: mod_info

Version 0.0.1.

<h3>Added:</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Party Actions:</strong> Added Reformist, Left, and Center paths, alongside substantial nerfs to many actions.</li>
  <li><strong>Pacing:</strong> Time now passes twice as slowly.</li>
  <li><strong>Party Congresses:</strong> Added party congresses; <em>Shuffle Leadership</em> has been removed.</li>
  <li><strong>Other Parties:</strong> Added DNVP and DVP congresses.</li>
  <li><strong>Internal &amp; External Politics:</strong> Added new factions and establishment reactions.</li>
  <li><strong>Consistency Update:</strong> Normal difficulty can now drop cards without advancing the month.</li>
  <li><strong>QOL &amp; Balance:</strong> Added numerous quality-of-life and balance changes.</li>
</ul>